      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture. The original test has several understandability issues:\n- Many unused imports\n- Unused `CHARSET_UTF8` constant\n- Unused `testBase16InBuffer` private method (with a typo: `startPasSize`)\n- An indirect `getRandom()` accessor when `random` can be used directly\n- `toString()` name clashes conceptually with `Object.toString()` and lacks descriptive intent\n- Variable names `data`, `enc`, `data2` are generic and don't convey encode/decode semantics\n\nI'll now write the improved version.Now I'll compile-check it.The improved test compiled successfully."
